---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { loadSiteContent } from '../lib/content';

const { showNotes } = await loadSiteContent();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Experience"
  description="Don Yuen's work history and education."
  showNotes={showNotes}
>
  <div class="page prose">
    <h1>Experience</h1>
    <p class="lede">Work history and education.</p>
    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <h3>Store Manager, Fuzzy Paws Tavern</h3>
    <p>May 2024 – May 2025 · Queens, NY</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Managed daily operations for a pet grooming and boarding boutique and
        led 1 full-time and 2 part-time staff.
      </li>
      <li>
        Expanded the store's capacity for large dogs, a premium service that
        brought in 15 to 20 percent of total revenue.
      </li>
      <li>
        Ran the store's CRM and back-end systems, including client records and
        appointment history.
      </li>
      <li>
        Standardized service procedures and client communications, and resolved
        client escalations.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Consultation Agent, Geek Squad (Best Buy)</h3>
    <p>
      Aug 2019 – Jan 2024 · New York, NY · Part-time, then full-time for the
      final 6 months
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Diagnosed hardware and software problems for 15 to 25 clients a day from
        client reports and hands-on testing.
      </li>
      <li>
        Repaired devices, including component swaps and soldering, and logged
        precise service orders in Apple GSX and NOVA.
      </li>
      <li>
        Troubleshot VPN and network problems, and helped clients spot scams and
        recover after being scammed.
      </li>
      <li>
        Trained 4 to 6 new hires and handled escalated client concerns under
        time pressure.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Sales Associate (Computers), Best Buy</h3>
    <p>Jul 2018 – Aug 2019 · New York, NY</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        Advised customers on hardware specs and system requirements and matched
        them to the right products.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <h3>Bachelor of Science in Computer Science, Queens College (CUNY)</h3>
    <p>Jan 2024 – Aug 2026 · Queens, NY</p>
    <p>
      Relevant coursework: Database Systems, Data Structures and Algorithms,
      Deep Learning and Systems
    </p>
    <h3>
      Associate in Applied Science, Computer Engineering Technology,
      Queensborough Community College (CUNY)
    </h3>
    <p>Aug 2020 – Jan 2023 · Queens, NY</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .lede {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: clamp(21px, 3.4vw, 26px);
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
</style>
